  "worked_solution": "Let's examine the solids one-by-one.\n\n- I is a polyhedron but it has only $5$ faces.\n\n- II is not a polyhedron (its top and bottom faces are not polygons).\n\n- III is a polyhedron and it has exactly $7$ faces.",
